{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "184ad2ffe0c33de2b1ba1c7ed026e984ae60ba170e2163efc46f4bd6f93534f7", "ja": "いよいよ『アイメガ』本番。互いにデュオと\nして高め合ってきた765プロと961プロ\nは、余裕を見せながらも、視線は火花を散ら\nす。客席も最高のコンディション……伝説の\nステージの予兆を感じるプロデューサー。", "zh": "『偶像超级大汇演』的正式演出终于到来。作为双人组合互相激励至今的765事务所与961事务所，虽然表现得从容不迫，目光交汇处却迸发出火花。观众席的状态也绝佳……制作人感受到了传说舞台即将诞生的预兆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1000_se", "source_sha256": "ea71aae72a262572623f8da617119e360889f6e46cba47f2db54237b4a022e7e", "ja": "ワアアーーーッ！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "fff0f1b1448fbd290b523879be294524cda40a8dba4684d62f1b439cf26bc399", "ja": "（いよいよ『アイメガ』の本番がやってきた。\n開演に向けて、客席も最高潮の盛り上がりだ！）", "zh": "（终于迎来了《偶像超级大联盟》的正式演出。为了开场，观众席的气氛也高涨到了顶点！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ac5d356a9e6499648fcf7da72e2ccab9897634b30e0cabf8ce60cc2d0e2a8d79", "ja": "響さーん！　ケータリングの料理、すっごく\nおいしかったですよね！　ステーキもあったし♪", "zh": "响姐——！餐饮准备的饭菜超级好吃，对吧！还有牛排呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "eac10f1df9316fbe75042a3ca2a7069dd102b8e5e70f55ea27652d29a4871a7a", "ja": "そうそう、豪華だったよね！\nあんなの、自分達のライブで見たことないぞ……。", "zh": "对对，特别丰盛呢！\n那种规格的自家演唱会餐点，我可从来没见过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "13a27c57bc6f715e5f84204ec3f7ca1ca123f2c37b8782fd276904a373a2c0ec", "ja": "い、いや、出せないこともないんだぞ？\nただ、栄養バランスとかを考えて……。", "zh": "不、不是，也不是拿不出来好吗？\n只是考虑到营养均衡什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1005_kuroi", "source_sha256": "955cd494640c1cecba68fccf4da08385c943352039a45300df3dfa4820a8a2fc", "ja": "ククク、ケータリングでもアイドルに惨めな思いをさせ\nるとは、隙のない底辺らしさだな。さすが765プロ！", "zh": "呵呵呵，连供餐都能让偶像感到凄惨，真是毫无破绽的底层作风啊。不愧是765制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f5410baf3eab6dd7cb71ab03fb1f3b75c8ab666f834fcd859272661c67311aae", "ja": "黒井社長……！\n今日のイベント、よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "黑井社长……！\n今天的活动，还请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1007_kuroi", "source_sha256": "f72d86bed046770e26ff37abafce69e5cfd44b9a33c7458910bd3b57ddfa1503", "ja": "ああ、金輪際、私の視界に入らないようよろしく。\nさて……我那覇響、伊吹翼。", "zh": "啊，总之，今后请别再出现在我的视线里。\n那么……我那霸响，伊吹翼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1008_kuroi", "source_sha256": "721f40763a269937206692e18a6d6a87414d098f2dd97bcb071f97516851cf2d", "ja": "無様な醜態をさらしておきながら、わざわざ恥の\n上塗りに現れるとは、物好きなことだ。", "zh": "明明已经丢尽了脸，居然还特意跑来继续丢人，真是个怪人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1009_kuroi", "source_sha256": "b2ac911b6e2f85308454247337943a59e8cb97e9c90e6dbe87f47cba04904601", "ja": "望み通り、圧倒的な力の差を思い知らせてやろう！\nそれとも移籍を真剣に考えたりしたのかな？　ククク！", "zh": "如你所愿，让你好好见识一下压倒性的实力差距！\n还是说，你已经认真考虑过转会了？　嘿嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "69adbac37df09a73716e976816bf3da8c7fe340c186b28ad168a1622365de3a2", "ja": "移籍？　あはははっ、するわけないでしょ！\nそんなの、考えたこともないさー。", "zh": "转籍？哈哈哈哈，怎么可能！我连想都没想过啦——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "2781698fb81090a9b0051538cc7f474c21f9b8d377caaa51c001b40960bd58c0", "ja": "黒井社長こそ、961プロをたたんでウチに来たら？\nきっと毎日楽しいぞ！", "zh": "黑井社长才是，把961事务所关了，来我们这边怎么样？每天肯定都很开心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1012_kuroi", "source_sha256": "b5e3342598a766d9d5614eec5ee927fe47cfa5331bd51fdeed0bf66a1fc85350", "ja": "ヒイイッ！　耳にしただけで卒倒しかけたではないか、\nこの沖縄ハイサイ娘が！　少しは身のほどを知れ！", "zh": "呀啊啊！光是听到这话，我差点就要昏倒了！\n你这个冲绳嗨萨伊姑娘，多少也该认清自己的身份吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6c58757720ac5fda9ab74f17ba08351e039fc40671eea8b9ca7dd2bbf52d269e", "ja": "移籍って……。そんな話しましたっけ？", "zh": "说到转籍……我们聊过这种事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1014_kuroi", "source_sha256": "7e4b60130d3eb81189f1ec604f846a3a566ac57194e6c765e24b78b5fdc48f66", "ja": "貴様は記憶力がないのか、この金髪トンガリ頭め！\n私のスタイリッシュなスカウトを忘れるとは！！", "zh": "你这金发尖脑袋，难道没有记性吗！\n竟然忘了我那场时髦帅气的招募！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7c3f718351adb7baf601ff0b982833ec45d4377a3017a0caf50d85f1e87ce20d", "ja": "覚えてても行きませんよ？　豪華なケータリングは\nうらやましいけど、劇場近くのファミレスでいいし♪", "zh": "就算记得也不会去的哦？　豪华外卖\n是挺让人羡慕的，但剧场附近的家庭餐厅就够了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "91464349591e4571c60a6deb2e0ef0105765487fcda48eb05034f9d70c17ace5", "ja": "それに響さんとか、{$P$}さんとか！\nわたしの大好きはぜーんぶ、劇場にあるんだもん！", "zh": "还有响姐、{$P$}先生之类的！我最喜欢的一切，全都在剧场里嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1017_kuroi", "source_sha256": "78ee2b9f652d5f829df091d49959989463711191d14bb7bd763c408e260e9faa", "ja": "……ええい！　楽しいだの大好きだの、どこまでお花畑\nなのだ！　もういい！　貴様たちに見込みはない！！", "zh": "……可恶！什么开心不开心、喜欢不喜欢的，到底要天真\n到什么地步！够了！你们根本无可救药！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1018_202xxx", "source_sha256": "9b89538c866b9638ad5250c0f45bd1b3f30136b14bae4c93008eb6fd0c1136d9", "ja": "おっと、もうその辺でいいんじゃないかな。\n……やあ、みんな、お疲れさま！", "zh": "哎呀，差不多可以了吧。\n……嗨，大家，辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1019_201xxx", "source_sha256": "ece2dc074901549a505199ffecb8261f9bf8215de4aac5f4b109d9a0865265fe", "ja": "グリュース・ゴット♪\n今日はよろしくお願いしますね。", "zh": "你好♪  \n今天请多关照哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "1e25098802325117bbade0f8964df212ead2e752e1c5923e98f99f7eb1a90a31", "ja": "玲音、詩花！　えへへ、今日の自分達のステージ、\n楽しみにしててよね！　ねっ、翼！", "zh": "玲音、诗花！嘿嘿，今天我们两个的舞台，要好好期待一下哦！对吧，翼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5e578cc5ad3a12c97232519202ebaca4b414afd5d979596843ac9371bdd133d7", "ja": "うん、響さん！　わたし達二人で、\n最っ高～に盛り上げちゃいましょうね♪", "zh": "嗯，响！我们两个人一起，把气氛炒到最高潮吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1022_202xxx", "source_sha256": "1ac3d65b7a532a60b972694ebe1ce3e7e092ff8a5569d469147b4ee76da12ab5", "ja": "なるほど……フフッ、二人とも、いい目になったね。\nさては、キミが魔法でもかけたのかな？", "zh": "原来如此……呵呵，两个人的眼神都变得很棒了呢。莫非是你施了什么魔法？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "5fa37febdbb2a9e6c69da68625cfa6e8f70f819094e886ed61d54185d2d83443", "ja": "まさか。二人は、二人の力だけでデュオになったんだ。\nむしろ玲音、君の予想通りじゃないのか？", "zh": "怎么会。她们两人，是完全靠自己的力量结成组合的。\n不如说玲音，这不是正合你的预料吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1024_202xxx", "source_sha256": "84141d024856c02ff285d7dac0cdfc2b4f8f7a0fd8ec57eaa25984437b21a802", "ja": "とんでもない。アタシはただ、こうなるといいなって\n勝手に思ってただけ。詩花は信じていたけどね♪", "zh": "哪有。我只是自顾自地想着，要是能变成这样就好了而已。虽然诗花一直相信就是了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1025_201xxx", "source_sha256": "152b19e62c36cb2b727fed574bc2b07e372e297e18c1d33b67ef981b2b31aade", "ja": "ふふっ、私は、みなさんのファンっていうだけです。\n今日はお互い、全力を出し切りましょうね！", "zh": "呵呵，我只是大家的粉丝而已。今天我们彼此都拿出全部实力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "38d71afeb855f4f3a7092d93a880657630bc8fd54903a05b0f040aee1177350f", "ja": "おっと……そろそろ始まるな。\nしっかり見届けさせてもらうよ。二人とも頑張って！", "zh": "哦……差不多要开始了。\n我会好好见证的。你们两个加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1027_013hib", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1029_kuroi", "source_sha256": "4b37eea6f044e2403d76b4af546904cb2d779c917154c5be0ded628bc501b10b", "ja": "フン。お前たちも……準備はいいな？", "zh": "哼。你们……准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1030_kuroi", "source_sha256": "ac92c3bc6bfe192f21133b6dc190659582c9248ef1faf6b0687a4a5ab95c005f", "ja": "ゆけ、『ZWEIGLANZ』！　燦然たるその輝きで、\n決して届かぬ高みがあることを、世界に示すのだ！", "zh": "去吧，“ZWEIGLANZ”！用那灿烂的光芒，\n向世界展现何为绝对无法企及的高峰吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1031_202xxx", "source_sha256": "4c55284c1bbf277ff2c5fe8039ac49ad641f9c19bce468da7b1278036f924dad", "ja": "OK！（はいっ♪）", "zh": "OK！（好～♪）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1032_201xxx", "source_sha256": "ca939ab70d11ce9f42cdad68a37966a8c39bce476d08726b4fc30639aa18c93a", "ja": "はいっ♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0127_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_06_1033_p", "source_sha256": "de900ee0060082d0761fd5f7d8de0f07052673f3ade4f138d41f49d1c5934aca", "ja": "（アイドル達も会場も、最高のコンディションだ。\n今、伝説が誕生しようとしているのかもしれないな！）", "zh": "（偶像们和会场都处于最佳状态。说不定，传说正要在此刻诞生了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
